{
	"title": "Colorier une fraction d'une figure",
	"description": "Colorier les parts d'une figure partagée en parts égales pour représenter une fraction : 3/8 sur 8 parts, 3/4 sur 8 parts, 7/4 sur deux bandes de 4",
	"grades": ["CM1"],
	"theme": "Fractions",
	"domain": "Apprivoiser",
	"subdomain": "Partage",
	"level": 2,
	"delay": 45,
	"status": "draft",
	"options": {
		"constraints": {
			"reducedFractions": "off"
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Colorie $\\frac{{{n}}}{{{d}}}$ de la figure.\n\n```partage\nforme: {{if:k==0|bande|disque}} {{d}}\ncolorier: {{n}}/{{d}}\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "0..1"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "2..12"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "1..{{eval:d-1}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**La figure est partagée en ${{d}}$ parts égales** : une part, c'est $\\frac{1}{{{d}}}$ de la figure.",
					"On colorie $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{n}}}$ part{{if:n>1|s|}}, n'importe lesquelles."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Colorie $\\frac{{{n}}}{{{d}}}$ de la figure.\n\n```partage\nforme: {{if:k==0|bande|disque}} {{N}}\ncolorier: {{n}}/{{d}}\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "0..1"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "2..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "N",
					"expression": "eval:m*d"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "1..{{eval:d-1}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["N<=12"],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**La figure a ${{N}}$ parts, pas ${{d}}$** : on les regroupe par ${{m}}$. $${{N}} = {{d}} \\times {{m}}$$",
					"Un {{if:d==2|demi|{{if:d==3|tiers|{{if:d==4|quart|{{if:d==5|cinquième|sixième}}}}}}}} de la figure, c'est ${{m}}$ parts : $\\frac{{{n}}}{{{d}}} = \\frac{{{eval:n*m}}}{{{N}}}$.",
					"On colorie $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:n*m}}}$ parts, n'importe lesquelles."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Chaque bande est une unité. Colorie $\\frac{{{n}}}{{{d}}}$ de l'unité.\n\n```partage\nforme: bande {{d}}\nunites: {{u}}\ncolorier: {{n}}/{{d}}\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "{{eval:d+1}}..{{eval:3*d-1}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "eval:(n-mod(n,d))/d+1"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["mod(n,d)!=0"],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Chaque bande est partagée en ${{d}}$ parts égales** : une part, c'est $\\frac{1}{{{d}}}$ de l'unité.",
					"$\\frac{{{n}}}{{{d}}}$, c'est ${{n}}$ parts : plus d'une bande. On colorie $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{n}}}$ parts, sur les bandes qu'il faut."
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "3 parts sur 8",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"d": "8",
				"n": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "3 parts quelconques",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"d": "8",
				"n": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["2, 5, 8"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 5 parts (les non coloriées)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"d": "8",
				"n": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3, 4, 5"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "3/4 sur 8 parts : 6 parts",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"d": "4",
				"m": "2",
				"N": "8",
				"n": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 3 parts (dénominateur lu comme le nombre de parts)",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"k": "0",
				"d": "4",
				"m": "2",
				"N": "8",
				"n": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "7/4 : 7 parts sur deux bandes",
			"variationIndex": 2,
			"variables": {
				"d": "4",
				"n": "7",
				"u": "2"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 3 parts (1 + 3/4 lu 3/4)",
			"variationIndex": 2,
			"variables": {
				"d": "4",
				"n": "7",
				"u": "2"
			},
			"answers": ["1, 2, 3"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Rien colorié : case vide",
			"variationIndex": 2,
			"variables": {
				"d": "4",
				"n": "7",
				"u": "2"
			},
			"answers": [""],
			"expected": {
				"status": "empty"
			}
		}
	]
}
